# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Changed
- Shortened the README and moved detailed installation, configuration, and pipeline guidance into the documentation.

## [0.3.1.20]

### Fixed
- `ObservationSummary` / `listobs_fits.out` scan times now use the UV_DATA `DATE` column, so dates roll over at midnight and scans crossing midnight are no longer dropped ([#74](https://github.com/avikhagol/avica/issues/74)).

### Added
- configuration parameter `force_reset` in `PreProcessFitsIdi` which will copy the fits file to the working directory.

